  "post_title": "Compromís celebra actes a Cafeteria Druida d'Onda i l'alberg Pla del Riu, a Suera",
  "post_date": "2015-05-05 07:40:59",
  "post_name": "compromis-celebra-actes-a-cafeteria-druida-donda-i-lalber-pla-del-riu-a-suera",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>La Cafeteria Druida, al carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 d&#39;Onda, ha acollit aquest dissabte una tert&uacute;lia amb Enric Nomdedeu Biosca, diputat provincial de Comprom&iacute;s, presentat per Llu&iacute;s Pastor Catalan i Emi Tirado Bodel&oacute;n, n&uacute;meros 1 i 2 de la llista a l&#39;Ajuntament.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/IMG_5065.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>A l&#39;acte han assistit tamb&eacute; Vicent Marz&agrave; Ib&aacute;&ntilde;ez, que encap&ccedil;ala la candidatura de Comprom&iacute;s a les Corts per la circunscripci&oacute; de Castell&oacute;, Marta Sorl&iacute;, integrant tamb&eacute; de la llista auton&ograve;mica, o Manolo Llorens Gonz&aacute;lez, candidat a l&#39;alcaldia de Suera per la coalici&oacute; valencianista, progressista i ecologista.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/IMG_6301.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Diumenge, a l&#39;alberg municipal Pla del Riu, a Suera, Llorens i la majoria d&#39;integrants de la llista municipal han mantingut un contacte amb representants de col&middot;lectius per a perfilar propostes per a l&#39;Ajuntament.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5055.jpg\" alt=\"img_5055\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5058.jpg\" alt=\"img_5058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5060.jpg\" alt=\"img_5060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5065.jpg\" alt=\"img_5065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5067.jpg\" alt=\"img_5067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5069.jpg\" alt=\"img_5069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5071.jpg\" alt=\"img_5071\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5076.jpg\" alt=\"img_5076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5078.jpg\" alt=\"img_5078\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5080.jpg\" alt=\"img_5080\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5082.jpg\" alt=\"img_5082\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5087.jpg\" alt=\"img_5087\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5088.jpg\" alt=\"img_5088\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5092.jpg\" alt=\"img_5092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5096.jpg\" alt=\"img_5096\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actescompromisdruidasuera/img_5099.jpg\" alt=\"img_5099\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2